      "text": "Statistical analysis and the equivalent of a Thouless energy in lattice QCD Dirac spectra — 14 sections: Front matter; Introduction; Complete Dirac spectra in SU(2) ga\n\n**Statistical analysis and the equivalent of a Thouless energy in lattice QCD Dirac spectra**\n\n*T. Guhr1, J.-Z. Ma1, S. Meyer2 and T. Wilke1*\n\n26 pp, 14 sections.\n\n**Outline.** Front matter; 1 Introduction; 2 Complete Dirac spectra in SU(2) gauge theory; 3 Data analysis; 3.1 Unfolding; 3.1.1 Ensemble unfolding; 3.1.2 Configuration unfolding; 3.1.3 Windowing; 3.2 Nearest Neighbor Spacing Distribution; 3.3 Two--Point Spectral Correlations; 3.4 Higher Order Spectral Correlations; 3.5 Qualitative discussion of the deviations f; 4 Summary and discussion; Acknowledgments",
